  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Jim Shay is an American real estate professional and education supporter associated with Southborough, Massachusetts. A history graduate of Boston College, he served as president of Fay School's trustees. He and his wife, Monica, established university financial-aid funds, including a scholarship named for his father, businessman Joseph F. Shay Sr.",
    "confidence": {
